OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold start to the day
OL,6,Fwith an early frost. It will remain
OL,7,Fdry and settled during the day with
OL,8,Flengthy spells of sunshine and light
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,12,Flargely clear skies but a bit cloudier
OL,13,Faround the east coast. It will stay
OL,14,Fdry overnight with some frost in
OL,15,Fplaces again.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,18,Fmorning with an early frost. Becoming
OL,19,Fdull and cloudy from the southeast
OL,20,Fthrough the afternoon with the odd
OL,21,Fspot of light rain possible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
